OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after blaze at
OL,4,Ablock of flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated from a
OL,7,Fblock of flats after a fire overnight.
OL,9,FThe fire service said crews were called
OL,10,Fto Keel House on Dorchester Road,
OL,11,FWeymouth, at 00:38 BST after a blaze on
OL,12,Fthe top floor spread to the roof space.
OL,14,FAt the height of the fire, eight
OL,15,Fappliances, including a support unit
OL,16,Fand aerial ladder platform (ALPs), were
OL,17,Fat the scene, said Dorchester and
OL,18,FWiltshire Fire and Rescue Service.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
