OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after blaze at
OL,4,Ablock of flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update at about 10:00, it said
OL,7,Fthree appliances and an ALP remained at
OL,8,Fthe site, with road closures in place
OL,9,Fand people advised to avoid the area.
